# Keep the build context small and reproducible: only the Rust workspace
# (root crate + swap-ffi + lez-mcp + programs/) and offer-publisher/ are
# needed to build swap-cli + the sidecar (see Dockerfile).
.git
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Desktop app + Nix module packaging — irrelevant to the maker container.
# (tests/ stays IN the context: Cargo.toml declares [[test]] targets with
# required-features, and cargo validates the declared paths exist at
# manifest parse time — see the COPY tests line in the Dockerfile.)
swap-ui/
swap-module/
canary/
contracts/
docs/
scripts/
.scaffold/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.github/

*.md
!README.md

# Local dev state that must never leak into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
.maker-state.json
*.status.json
